      "distinction": "Full origin reconstruction needs build_core_study_v2.py +2plans+worker; continuation from frozen core2 uses its.blend/report without needing core1 or graystudies1–4. V5 addrear script reads core2 directly, not grayv4.",
      "non_input_path": "/tmp/housing-current-debug.blend is WRITTEN diagnostically by addrearv5; not a missing input to publish."
    },
    {
      "recipe": "head",
      "result": "All9required direct scripts/numeric inputs/imports and editable barrel dependency are present and byte-covered by preflight32/review46.",
      "important_exclusion": "control_geometry.csg is imported but then shadowed by csg_driver_v2.csg; the head actually calls its own csg_kernel_v2.py. Do not incorrectly add front-brake-plate/csg.py to this head recipe."
    },
    {
      "recipe": "cap",
      "result": "Missing manifest closure for actual worker front-brake-plate/csg.py; control_geometry.csg invokes this file in a subprocess. File exists locally; current Git status given in files.",
      "missing_paths": [
        "assets-src/moto-components/front-brake-plate/csg.py"
      ],
      "parent_boundary": "This regenerates cap from fixed editable engine-headv2. Regenerating that parent itself is the separately audited9file head recipe; no need to publish unrelated older head studies."
    },
    {
      "recipe": "cables",
      "result": "Two required numeric inputs absent from preflight30/supplement34/review42 union: the shared datum JSON checked by read_bytes/SHA assertion, and ignition-lock parameters read to transform the loop.",
      "missing_paths": [
        "creative/workflow/motorcycle-datums-v1.json",
        "assets-src/moto-components/ignition-lock/parameters.json"
      ],
      "important_exclusion": "No csg helper is called by this cable builder, so front-brake-plate/csg.py is not a cable dependency. The3frozen interface blends are already covered."
